@startuml main_task
title 主任务：提交、执行与结果提交
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #4A6FA5

actor "用户" as User
participant "CLI / HTTP" as API
participant "TaskQueue" as Queue
participant "TaskProcess" as Task
database "主数据库" as DB
participant "MemoryPrepare" as Recall
participant "ModelRuntime" as Runtime
participant "ReviewScheduler" as Review

User -> API: 提交 session_id、text、可选 request_key
API -> Queue: Submit(TurnRequest)
note over Queue: 检查幂等键与容量；同键同内容复用原任务
Queue -> DB: RegisterTurn：登记 queued 任务
Queue -> Queue: 发布到进程内队列
Queue --> API: task_id
API --> User: 接收成功，返回任务 ID

group 单个主任务 worker
    Queue -> Task: Run(task_id, context)
    Task -> DB: 加载会话、历史与冻结提示词
    note over Task: 首次准备会话时读取授权画像并冻结系统提示
    Task -> DB: BeginTurn：保存本轮用户消息
    DB --> Task: 会话与历史快照
    Task -> Recall: 当前问题、权限和任务期限
    Recall --> Task: 召回证据、状态与 warnings
    Task -> Task: AttachRecall：增强本次请求副本
    Task -> Runtime: Run(主任务策略)
    Runtime --> Task: RunResult
    Task -> DB: FinishTurn：原子提交结果与终态
    Task --> API: 经 TaskEvents / SSE 发布 task_committed
    API --> User: 展示已提交结果
end

opt completed、启用复盘且达到轮次阈值
    Task -> DB: ObserveReviewTurn
    DB --> Task: 固定的历史结束位置
    Task ->> Review: Schedule(session_id, through_message_id)
end

note over DB: 重启修复中断任务状态，保留已提交数据；不自动重放工具
@enduml
